    "title": "Lynx Open Playoffs Tomorrow - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Learfield Wire Services ,\n21 hours ago (Minneapolis, MN) -- The postseason has arrived for the Minnesota Lynx as they embark on the playoffs with championship aspirations. Their first hurdle is a best of three series against New York which will begin Sunday afternoon at Target Center. The Liberty took two of three in the regular season with Minnesota getting their only win on July 11th when they beat New York 90-85. The Liberty also beat the Lynx for the 2024 W-N-B-A title when they took the trophy home in five games. The series tips off at 1 P-M Sunday afternoon from Minneapolis. Read full article",
